WEBVTT

00:00:57.204 --> 00:01:00.537
or survivors from
the lost continent of Atlantis

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:02.829
invented hieroglyphic writing.

00:01:02.871 --> 00:01:07.621
Now, most of us know
that claims like these are unfounded

00:01:07.663 --> 00:01:09.829
and frankly absurd.

00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:11.538
Yet they're everywhere.

00:01:11.579 --> 00:01:16.246
They're on TV shows,
in movies and in books.

00:01:17.621 --> 00:01:20.913
Think of the History Channel series
"Ancient Aliens,"

00:01:20.954 --> 00:01:23.704
currently in its 15th season,

00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:27.579
or of the most recent Indiana Jones movie

00:01:27.621 --> 00:01:30.079
about the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull,